From 0ac4df2d362637eaf95b19346e163630deff8703 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 11:25:22 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add Query History: permanent slow-query log with Excel export

Adds a per-machine opt-in background job (Next.js instrumentation hook,
no external cron) that records every query running 30+ minutes into a
new SlowQueryLog table, categorized into four severity tiers (30-60min,
1-2hr, 2-3hr, 3hr+). New "Query History" nav page filters by machine,
database, severity, and date range, with an Excel export. 30-day
retention with automatic daily cleanup.

Also fixes PATCH /api/connections/[id] to be a genuine partial update
(previously always overwrote all three AWS fields together, which would
have silently clobbered them whenever only the new tracking toggle was
saved).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_018pPwufrj8rxqA2zd9xoSRi
